WEBVTT

00:05.990 --> 00:09.950
{first frame of Monkey Punch mountain}

00:17.580 --> 00:20.330
OH! The time has come

00:18.120 --> 00:18.710
BUSTERZ!

00:20.330 --> 00:23.710
To stand up for tomorrow

00:22.670 --> 00:24.130
OH OH OH!

00:23.710 --> 00:26.300
We're ghostbusterz

00:26.300 --> 00:30.930
Breakin' away from the old ghosts

00:30.930 --> 00:34.310
Of history

00:34.310 --> 00:37.680
Breaking free!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

01:03.750 --> 01:05.250
GHOST BUSTERZ!

01:13.180 --> 01:16.970
No fear for anything in our way!

01:15.600 --> 01:20.390
Presented by hwat fansubs

01:16.970 --> 01:18.520
The time has come

01:33.070 --> 01:37.660
The seventh month of 1600 AD, or Keicho 5.

01:37.660 --> 01:41.620
Charging Tokugawa Ieyasu with
thirteen articles of impeachment,

01:41.620 --> 01:48.550
Ishida Mitsunari sent messengers to various daimyo in the name of the Toyotomi clan,

01:48.550 --> 01:51.720
telling them to raise armies.

01:51.720 --> 01:56.800
At the same time, beings seeking to end the period of turbulence

01:56.800 --> 02:00.680
and build a kingdom to last a thousand years

02:00.680 --> 02:04.940
were about to awaken from a thousand-year sleep.

02:04.940 --> 02:06.940
And then...

02:06.940 --> 02:10.690
On the fifteenth day of the ninth month, at Sekigahara,

02:10.690 --> 02:13.150
the Eastern Army of Tokugawa Ieyasu clashed with

02:13.150 --> 02:18.280
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and Ishida Mitsunari.

02:18.280 --> 02:21.750
As a result of the performance of Kobayakawa Hideaki's troops,

02:21.750 --> 02:27.670
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and
Ishida Mitsunari achieved a sweeping victory,

02:27.670 --> 02:34.550
bringing what should have been
three hundred years of peace to the world.

02:34.550 --> 02:40.140
You should all be quite familiar with this story...

02:46.980 --> 02:49.820
THE PATH OF THE DEMON

04:13.480 --> 04:14.900
Musashi-sama...

04:15.820 --> 04:17.570
Please, hear my voice.

04:18.490 --> 04:21.030
Please, accept my heart.

04:22.370 --> 04:24.540
I ask this of you.

04:33.090 --> 04:35.170
A bird of light.

04:35.170 --> 04:37.130
The bird of dreams.

04:37.130 --> 04:39.300
Rukou is in the sky.

04:40.590 --> 04:42.050
Yumehime...

04:44.470 --> 04:45.850
Rukou.

04:45.850 --> 04:51.310
So you've come here to tell me that the dreamer has descended upon this land?

05:18.510 --> 05:20.380
You there, can you do anything?

05:20.380 --> 05:23.470
No, my body's not doing what I tell it to.

05:24.510 --> 05:28.600
So we can do nothing but wait for Musashi's awakening?

05:29.640 --> 05:31.520
Musashi's body...!

05:37.280 --> 05:41.400
Don't worry, I'm certain that Musashi can use that gun.

05:41.400 --> 05:42.910
Where am I?

05:43.610 --> 05:47.830
Finally awake, Miss Desperado?

05:48.790 --> 05:50.080
Who are you?

05:50.080 --> 05:53.920
My name is Dabinoji, master of gadgets,

05:53.920 --> 05:56.960
and he is Sarutobi Sasuke.

05:56.960 --> 05:57.960
Okay?

05:59.630 --> 06:01.550
You can speak English?

06:01.550 --> 06:03.130
Ahh, a little.

06:04.390 --> 06:06.350
Where did Musashi go?

06:07.350 --> 06:10.020
He's in some pain over there.

06:18.150 --> 06:22.360
Musashi! Let go of it! Drop the gun!

06:22.360 --> 06:25.030
No! He must not drop it.

06:25.740 --> 06:29.740
Right now, Musashi-dono is fighting
the demon that dwells within the gun.

06:29.740 --> 06:34.420
If he lets go now, he'll never be able to hold the <i>gun-ki</i> again.

06:34.420 --> 06:36.130
He must endure.

07:00.440 --> 07:02.230
What is this place?

07:07.990 --> 07:09.490
Who's there?

07:42.610 --> 07:44.030
You're the demon!

07:49.030 --> 07:50.950
Oh, that's...!

07:52.330 --> 07:57.460
So you, too, have come here seeking this gun?

07:57.460 --> 07:59.830
Yeah, that's right.

07:59.830 --> 08:03.590
In that case, come defeat me!

08:03.840 --> 08:07.430
Heh, I figured it would end up being something like that.

08:07.430 --> 08:08.550
Perfect!

08:31.070 --> 08:32.700
You...!

08:34.080 --> 08:38.160
You just can't win. Become a demon, like me!

08:38.160 --> 08:39.290
The hell is that?

09:06.110 --> 09:08.440
Wh- Why?

09:08.440 --> 09:11.910
I just took a bullet straight to the chest...

09:12.530 --> 09:14.240
...b- but I'm alive.

09:23.130 --> 09:27.510
In this place, no matter how many bullets you take, you will not die.

09:27.510 --> 09:30.050
Well, that's good to hear,

09:30.050 --> 09:33.260
but man, it really does hurt.

09:33.260 --> 09:36.390
The pain remains as it would feel in reality.

09:38.520 --> 09:40.020
Next...

09:56.080 --> 09:57.330
Wait.

10:09.130 --> 10:12.800
I was so distracted that I stopped working.

10:12.800 --> 10:17.050
But this is a splendid opportunity to take down Musashi!

10:22.310 --> 10:23.850
Yasha-sama?

10:23.850 --> 10:27.190
We can finish him off at any time.

10:27.190 --> 10:30.440
For now, it may be good to see what will happen.

10:32.820 --> 10:36.780
Simply encase him in your thread until he awakens.

10:47.920 --> 10:51.670
No, we can only wait for Musashi to awaken.

10:51.670 --> 10:52.970
But!

10:55.550 --> 10:56.840
Dabinoji!

10:57.180 --> 10:58.350
Alrighty.

11:12.530 --> 11:14.360
These are all bullets?

11:15.320 --> 11:20.370
Yeah, these are special bullets that I've been painstakingly crafting for a long time now.

11:20.700 --> 11:22.240
Special bullets?

11:22.240 --> 11:24.830
All of them ended up too powerful,

11:24.830 --> 11:29.630
so you can't use them without a gun like the <i>gun-ki</i>.

11:32.840 --> 11:36.800
But now, we'll finally get to see them in action.

11:36.800 --> 11:39.090
Excellent, most excellent.

11:41.430 --> 11:43.810
Dabinoji, nothing yet?

11:43.810 --> 11:48.600
Come on, can't you tell I'm in the middle of preparing right now?

11:52.780 --> 11:54.490
Sasuke, it's up to you now.

11:58.820 --> 12:02.080
You'll be fine, just send it over there!

12:13.090 --> 12:15.970
So long as you're here, get that over to Musashi.

12:29.100 --> 12:31.610
You call yourself a monkey ninja? Go!

12:35.730 --> 12:37.570
Hurry up and go!

12:55.960 --> 12:57.090
Musashi.

12:57.590 --> 13:01.470
Wait for it. Right now, all we can do is wait.

13:18.490 --> 13:26.450
Now then, at this point, it is impossible for Musashi to escape from my strings.

13:26.450 --> 13:31.080
From here, we are free to deal with him however you wish, Yasha-sama.

13:31.870 --> 13:33.790
We will continue to wait.

13:35.250 --> 13:37.300
I wish to see for myself.

13:37.300 --> 13:42.590
Does there truly exist a human who can wield the <i>gun-ki</i> of legend?

13:43.510 --> 13:47.470
Yasha-sama, do you know of that gun?

13:47.930 --> 13:49.680
Do I <i>know</i> of it, you ask...

13:53.350 --> 13:59.320
Musashi, I shall observe whether you are a true <i>gun-dou</i> practitioner.

14:12.660 --> 14:16.540
Does it hurt? Do you feel the pain?

14:16.540 --> 14:18.000
Of course I do!

14:18.800 --> 14:21.970
This is the force of a gun.

14:35.350 --> 14:39.020
Bullets tear open human skin,

14:39.020 --> 14:41.610
bite deep into the flesh,

14:41.610 --> 14:44.110
and shred through the organs.

14:47.280 --> 14:51.830
The terror of what it means to pull the trigger...

14:56.040 --> 14:59.130
People use guns without knowing that.

15:02.920 --> 15:07.590
Such people will all become demons.

15:13.430 --> 15:18.360
All who have lost against this pain, this trial...

15:22.860 --> 15:24.900
...become demons.

15:35.750 --> 15:41.710
You, like all who came before you, will become a demon.

15:42.420 --> 15:43.800
I... I will <i>never</i> become a demon!

15:47.430 --> 15:49.470
We will see...

15:50.050 --> 15:51.720
...if those words are true.

16:21.840 --> 16:26.170
Now, every person awakens from this.

16:26.170 --> 16:30.260
The question is, will he retain his
humanity after he opens his eyes,

16:30.260 --> 16:33.060
or will he be reduced to a demon?

16:53.780 --> 16:54.790
The cocoon...!

16:54.790 --> 16:56.790
It's melting away.

16:59.410 --> 17:04.670
Musashi, show us the strength of your soul.

17:11.720 --> 17:13.800
I won't lose.

17:36.080 --> 17:37.240
Musashi!

17:38.830 --> 17:40.080
Musashi.

17:45.960 --> 17:49.010
I know he can do it. I'm sure of it!

18:10.360 --> 18:13.200
Miyamoto... Musashi!

19:08.340 --> 19:11.340
I take it you didn't become a demon?

19:11.340 --> 19:15.130
I haven't grown any horns, so I guess not? Probably.

19:18.800 --> 19:23.140
Well done. Finally, someone has prevailed against the demon.

19:23.640 --> 19:25.770
We've been waiting for the chance to strike back.

19:26.520 --> 19:29.770
Well, I don't remember anything about that.

19:38.660 --> 19:42.450
He defeated the demon, did he?

19:43.330 --> 19:46.160
Curse you, brat!

19:46.960 --> 19:50.170
You burned my threads!

20:01.100 --> 20:07.190
You may have obtained a powerful gun,
but that won't be enough to take me down!

20:37.340 --> 20:39.260
Nice one, Musashi.

20:41.010 --> 20:42.800
Alright, alright!

20:47.730 --> 20:51.860
He's so strong! Was he always that strong?

20:51.860 --> 20:55.280
That's the skill that the <i>gun-ki</i> can give.

20:55.280 --> 20:58.740
It multiplies the holder's latent potential tenfold—

20:58.740 --> 21:05.080
No, with full command, the <i>gun-ki</i> can boost it a hundredfold!

21:06.450 --> 21:09.500
You hag! This is the end!

21:28.020 --> 21:29.680
That bullet!

21:30.350 --> 21:32.150
Oho.

21:32.150 --> 21:38.860
Even without any instruction, Musashi can harness the flame shot mode of the <i>enkaboudan</i>!

21:57.250 --> 21:59.050
I've done it!

22:16.270 --> 22:17.610
Hot!

22:18.690 --> 22:19.860
It burns!

22:55.440 --> 22:59.900
Musashi, it seems I've underestimated you.

23:02.860 --> 23:07.740
I'll leave the <i>gun-ki</i> in your hands for now.

23:22.010 --> 23:23.260
Master Takuan.

23:28.760 --> 23:30.180
Musashi.

23:30.180 --> 23:35.190
You did well in overcoming the demon. From today on, the gun is yours.

23:35.190 --> 23:36.980
Wahoo!

23:37.770 --> 23:40.360
However, remember this:

23:40.360 --> 23:46.110
whoever carries that gun will,
sooner or later, become a demon.

24:00.590 --> 24:03.300
In my natural, unadorned style,

24:03.300 --> 24:06.170
I'll tell you these feelings of mine

24:06.170 --> 24:11.510
Together to the sky past the darkness!

24:11.510 --> 24:16.640
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

24:18.190 --> 24:23.320
Baby, we'll send time flowing forward just a little,

24:23.320 --> 24:29.490
and we'll embrace even the harsh gusts of wind

24:29.490 --> 24:34.830
with sympathy for pointless worries

24:34.830 --> 24:38.960
and a melody that will overcome the pain

24:41.290 --> 24:51.680
If the poison of the flower that bloomed in my cupped hands

24:51.680 --> 25:02.610
has managed to pierce through the center of my heart...

25:02.610 --> 25:05.360
In my natural, unadorned style,

25:05.360 --> 25:08.240
I'll tell you these feelings of mine,

25:08.240 --> 25:13.870
Unraveling this puzzle of the heart

25:13.870 --> 25:16.620
I'll bring out every part

25:16.620 --> 25:19.620
of your unchanging style

25:19.620 --> 25:24.920
Together to the sky past the darkness!

25:24.920 --> 25:30.050
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

25:31.510 --> 25:32.970
Who's this girl?

25:32.970 --> 25:34.850
Huh? Yumehime?

25:34.850 --> 25:37.220
She's been dreaming about me?

25:37.220 --> 25:40.480
And who the heck is Kobayakawa Hideaki?

25:40.480 --> 25:44.900
The next chapter: <i>Prison Cells and Dreams</i>!
